cause you are the creator of the map, but you already did it your self, good job.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1825-nachtfrische/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Nachtfrische</a></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":71673,"threadID":4736,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"","time":1504808212,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2615,"username":"Damon","time":1504808243,"value":1},{"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","time":1504808674,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>Damon</strong></cite><p>Updated the map to b3.<br></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Traitor room is now completely bulletproof except from AWPs</li>\n<li>Traitor trap added</li>\n<li>Custom player models can now be found around the map for 2 players</li>\n<li>Green boxes added</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://gamebanana.com/maps/196925\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a><br></p></blockquote><p>I&#x27;ve updated the map, thanks for listening to our community feedback on the server.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":71677,"threadID":4736,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"","time":1504811769,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2615,"username":"Damon","time":1504813435,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p><a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2615-damon/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Damon</a><br>Apparently, the two custom player models make the players invisible. Could you remove them again?</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>#doppelpost</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":71680,"threadID":4736,"userID":2615,"username":"Damon","subject":"","time":1504813397,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","